# What NOT to Do

- ❌ Never use SQLDelight or any local database
- ❌ Never store plaintext passwords
- ❌ Never use service_role key in app
- ❌ Never hardcode Supabase URL or keys
- ❌ Never pass NavController into ViewModel
- ❌ Never use Flow<T> from repository (no local DB to observe)
- ❌ Never write SQL directly in Kotlin (use postgrest DSL)
- ❌ Never edit migration files manually (regenerate with db diff)
- ❌ Never commit .env file
